ponentData": {"text": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px\"><strong>Пациент</strong></span></p><p>Мужчина, 68 лет. Обратился на амбулаторный прием к кардиологу.</p>"}, "componentName": "ContentText"}, {"id": 4, "componentData": {"text": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px\"><strong>Цель</strong></span></p><p>Проведите обследование, установите диагноз и назначьте лечение.</p>"}, "componentName": "ContentText"}, {"id": 5, "componentData": {"buttonsList": [{"image": {"label": "", "imageURL": ""}, "action": {"name": "next", "internalId": 0, "checkQuestion": false}, "buttonName": "Далее"}]}, "componentName": "ContentButtons"}], "stepBackgroundImage": {"label": "", "imageURL": ""}, "stepBackgroundImageOpacity": 0}, "internal_id": 2, "question_text": "", "created_by": "admin", "updated_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-06-06T10:21:43.613086Z", "updated_at": "2026-06-06T10:21:43.613086Z"}, {"id": 13681, "question_type_id": 2, "is_active": true, "test_id": 1152, "seq_no": 4, "body": {"name": "(2) Первичный осмотр", "content": [{"id": 1, "componentData": {"title": "Осмотр"}, "componentName": "ContentTitle"}, {"id": 2, "componentData": {"warnings": true, "sectionsList": [{"image": {"label": "", "imageURL": "https://ec888558-9aef-47ea-b714-138f4c46d9f3.selstorage.ru/testfiles/test-117/inspection1.svg"}, "action": {"name": "moveToStep", "internalId": 4, "checkQuestion": false}, "buttonName": "Жалобы"}, {"image": {"label": "", "imageURL": "https://ec888558-9aef-47ea-b714-138f4c46d9f3.selstorage.ru/testfiles/test-117/inspection2.svg"}, "action": {"name": "moveToStep", "internalId": 5, "checkQuestion": false}, "buttonName": "Анамнез заболевания"}, {"image": {"label": "", "imageURL": "https://ec888558-9aef-47ea-b714-138f4c46d9f3.selstorage.ru/testfiles/test-117/inspection3.svg"}, "action": {"name": "moveToStep", "internalId": 6, "checkQuestion": false}, "buttonName": "Анамнез жизни"}, {"image": {"label": "", "imageURL": "https://ec888558-9aef-47ea-b714-138f4c46d9f3.selstorage.ru/testfil